<div class="container" style="padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem; max-width: 900px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 2.6rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Terms of <span class="grad-text">Service</span></h1>
  <div class="card" style="padding: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-secondary);">
    <h3 style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">1. Platform Membership</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      By accessing FINVORA, you acknowledge that you are at least 18 years of age and legally permitted to engage in financial and digital asset operations in your jurisdiction.
    </p>

    <h3 style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">2. Account Types & Multipliers</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      Accounts are designated as Working IDs or Investor IDs. Income caps (3X for Working, 2X for Investor by default) are strictly enforced by the automated engine. When a package reaches its maximum multiplier, further package-linked returns cease until renewed.
    </p>

    <h3 style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">3. Withdrawal Policy</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      Withdrawals are subject to a standard 10% processing fee. Requests are verified and disbursed according to network security standards.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

